"""Hand measurements for tests/layout: every ride, attraction and key building of the 2025 official park map.

Map coordinates are pixels of reference/map/boardwalk-map-2025-pdf.jpg (1565 x 883), measured by eye on 3.3x-5x gridded
crops (10 px grid). `marker` is the number circle (refined automatically by colour in build_layout.py); `base` is where the
ride stands on the ground (centre of its footprint, at the bottom of tall structures); `outline` is the drawn silhouette on
the map (roof and height included, not a ground footprint). conf: how sure the base is (high +-4 px, medium +-8, low +-15).

OSM refs: n<id> node, w<id> way. The first ref is the primary one (its centroid is the ride's lat/lon).
Kinds and models: legend of the 2025 map + coasterpedia.net (Santa Cruz Beach Boardwalk) + Amusement Today Aug 2017.
Motion types for animation: spin, swing, path, slide, static, mixed.
"""

